      "value": "There is now/has been a mod that achieves this, and it just further shows the appeal in-action.\n\nObviously not something to use as it breaks rules of VRC, but: given how difficult it doesn't seem to have been (based off what I've learned) to make that addition.. I hope to see this soon.",
