      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is especially valuable for a social app such as VRChat *coming* from social platforms like Discord, and (if I recall) options to join games in progress that appear in other games using Rich Presence integrated into VRChat may be a streamlined way to join worlds that friends are in -with just a click. This already exists in a way off of the website. The \"vrchat://launch\" protocol is already implemented there and in-use.\n\nPlease continue to consider this.\nIt's a little touch that could go a long way.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
